Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "The Triforce is mine, and you will never
take it from me!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Its power is too great for you, but I see
you won't give. Gohmas! Capture the keeps!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "We can't lose the keeps in front of the
ruins. Defend them at any cost!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "I will take the east. You deal with the
west.",
  "1.0.4.0" => "They captured it? Take it back immediately!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Don't celebrate your victory yet. Here's
another treat for you.",
  "1.0.6.0" => "The tree monster now? Simply wonderful.",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Wizzro! Keep Manhandla at bay!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "But...I haven't even healed my wounds
from that last fight!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Just look at Ganondorf control those creatures...
When he says "Kill," they say "How painfully?"",
  "1.0.10.0" => "We have to strike at the heart of the problem.
Wizzro! Cut me a path through the enemy ranks!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "I...don't think so. My services belong to
the strongest: Lord Ganondorf!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "You would turn traitor, little magician? If
so, prove it by defeating your former allies.",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Hiya ha ha! Yes, let me demonstrate my power!
You won't be disappointed--I promise!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "You disgusting little cretin! I will annihilate
you for this!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Wizzro's treachery will have to wait. First
we must deal with those threatening our base.",
  "1.0.16.0" => "No matter what betrayals I may suffer, the
hero will always love and protect me...",
  "1.0.17.0" => "As I suspected. The constant use of dark
magic is unhinging the great sorceress.",
  "1.0.18.0" => "She is no longer worthy of my service. But
the day won't be a total loss...",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Ganondorf! I challenge you to a duel to
the death!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "An interesting offer, but I don't see much
of an upside for me. Away with you!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Grrrrraaaahhhhh! A trap!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "I see no way past this barrier. I suppose I
must retreat for now...",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Hiya ha! The number of monsters has waned?
So? The battle is still far from over!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Well, I can fix that...",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Haa... Haa... Seems I'm running out of power...
Not sure if I'll be able to summon any more...",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Noooo! Not back into the ring!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Enough playtime. It is time to take the
ruins!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Ganondorf...has even more power than I
imagined...",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Too many enemies! We c-c-can't win!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Master, we fail you! So sssorry!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "The hero is still by my side... The hero is
still by my side...",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Cia! You have to stop using magic! It's
eating your mind!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Lana...? Oh... What was I doing...? Oh,
right... I have to kill Ganondorf...",
  "1.0.34.0" => "I can help you! Together we can beat him!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "I thought I'd separated those two permanently.
No matter--I'll just kill them together.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Ganondorf is getting stronger by the
minute! We have to beat him soon!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "He's covered his lair in a darkness barrier.
We can't even get close to him!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "I think I can dispel the darkness, but I'll
need your help.",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Let's get this barrier down now!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Aaaaand light beats darkness!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "So you've destroyed my barrier. I'm mildly
impressed. But I'll still crush you!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "I can feel the magic flowing through me...
but it's not enough...",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Why are you hesitating? I thought you
were ready to kill me.",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Ahhh... Power is bubbling through me!
Challenge me now and perish!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "You are beneath my notice. I leave you to
wallow in your own insignificance.",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Great! It looks like we fought him off!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Then you don't need to be here anymore,
do you? Must be time for you to leave.",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Cia... You can just stop, you know. And if
you use any more magic, you'll...",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Just leave! No one can keep me from
getting everything I want!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "If I lose now...it'll all have been for
nothing...",
  "1.0.51.0" => "I... I wish I could help you, Cia...",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Such foolishness! I'll send this one next.",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Hiya ha ha! Is my strength overwhelming you?
Once you see my full power, you're done for!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Volga, your mistress commands you to obey!
Return to the base and guard it at once!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "I have no intention of obeying you one
second longer. I act of my own accord now!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "The base is in trouble! Manhandla's seed
attack must be terminated!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "The base will fall if this keeps up... Stop
wasting time and halt Manhandla's seed attack!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "They're approaching from the front.
Steel yourselves to them!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Ha ha ha! This is what happens
when you defy me!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Attack from the east. I'll attack from the
west, crushing them between us.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Do you really believe you can defeat
me with such a pitiful display?",
  "1.0.62.0" => "Hnnn... I couldn't stop them...",
  "1.0.63.0" => "Such bothersome little gnats.
I'll just have to scatter them!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "That was certainly nothing to fret over.",
  "1.0.65.0" => "That little wench is going for something...
but I won't let her get it!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Don't get in my way!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Thanks for helping me, Cia!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Silence! Just hurry and remove
that barrier!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Thank you! You saved me!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "I assure you, I only did so for the mission.
Now, hurry and complete your task.",
  "13.0.0.0" => "The enemy must not be allowed to seize the
keeps at the temple's front. Defend them!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "The eastern side of the map is mine to play
with. You can worry about the western side.",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Our keep's been captured? It sounds like
you should be retaking it, not crying to me!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Good. We're ready for a counteroffensive.
Wizzro! Commence the assault!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "The hero...will keep my base safe... That
will allow me...to take on Ganondorf...",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Ganondorf! I'll tear you to shreds! NO ONE
will be able to put you back together!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Curses! It's a trap!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "Hiding behind a barrier? Coward! No matter.
I'll retreat for now and save my strength...",
  "13.0.8.0" => "I...underestimated how much strength...
Ganondorf still possessed...",
  "13.0.9.0" => "My resolve has run out... I must leave
you...",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Mistress Cia, please, you must retreat. You
cannot hope to continue given your state.",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Shut up! You're wasting time worrying
about my health. Win me this battle!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "The base! It's at risk as long as
Manhandla's seed attack persists...",
  "13.0.13.0" => "If we don't stop Manhandla's seed attack,
the base will fall!",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Wizzro's magic is not our concern! Focus
your efforts on the vermin headed to our base!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "They're approaching from the front.
We have to fortify our defenses!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "Huh! It's still not enough.",
  "13.0.17.0" => "Looks like that group might
actually put up a good fight.",
  "13.0.18.0" => "That was relatively entertaining.",
  "13.0.19.0" => "I've got an idea! Let's lure the enemies to
the ruins and then lower a bridge elsewhere!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "This keep is continually spawning monsters!
We have to do something about it!",
  "13.0.21.0" => "The Engineer is moving out from the Allied
Base! Escort him to the East Ruins!",
  "13.0.22.0" => "Link can stop the enemies in the west!
Quickly, lower the bridge!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "You should take care of the enemies in
front of the ruins!",
  "13.0.24.0" => "Watch out! The enemies coming from the
west have their eyes on our base!",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Great work! Let's cross the bridge into
the ruins!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "The Engineer is done for...",
  "13.0.27.0" => "Cia is at the summit! Let's go!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "That monster is still alive! It may have fled
underground, but I just know it'll be back!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "Not a problem--leave it to us!
C'mon, Link! Let's go!",
  "13.0.30.0" => "Okay, leave it to us!
Link, strike hard!",
  "13.0.31.0" => "The Allied Base is under attack!
Quick, take care of that thing!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "Oh no! The Allied Base is in serious trouble!
We need to defeat that monster immediately!",
  "13.0.33.0" => "The Allied Base is crumbling! Hurry, hurry!",
  "13.0.34.0" => "Ah, what a shame! That was only a small
part of the creature...",
  "13.0.35.0" => "Good! Now we can get to Cia!
To the altar at the top of the ruins!",
  "13.0.36.0" => "Link! Did they get you?!",
  "13.0.37.0" => "Look out! Some of the enemies are going
after the Engineer!",
  "13.0.38.0" => "Oh? The gates to the ruins are closed.
Well, I guess we're not going in that way...",
  "13.0.39.0" => "Link and I will push ahead on the east side.
We'll leave the west to you!",
}